        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by improper management of dialog profile linkers in the `unset_dlg_profile` function. Specifically, the function was removing all linkers instead of just the one it was intended to delete, failing to unlink the specific linker, and not correctly copying the values during the temporary storage of linkers. This led to memory leaks and incorrect behavior when cleaning up dialog profiles.

